{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51240","headline":"又作妃子所遗罗袜铭 · 李隆基","name":"又作妃子所遗罗袜铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罗袜罗袜，香尘生不绝。\n细细圆圆，地下得琼鈎；窄窄弓弓，手中弄新月。\n又如脱履露纤圆，恰似同衾见时节。\n方知清梦事非虚，暗引相思几时歇？\n（以上《诗话总龟》三三《纪梦门》）（此二首疑出後人依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李隆基","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}